# text = I thought he was trying to read my character , but I felt as secure against his scrutiny as if I had had on a casque with the visor down-or rather I showed him my countenance with the confidence that one would show an unlearned man a letter written in Greek ; he might see lines , and trace characters , but he could make nothing of them ; my nature was not his nature , and its signs were to him like the words of an unknown tongue .
