# text = Ere long he turned away abruptly , as if baffled , and left the counting-house ; he returned to it but twice in the course of that day ; each time he mixed and swallowed a glass of brandy-and-water , the materials for making which he extracted from a cupboard on one side of the fireplace ; having glanced at my translations -- he could read both French and German -- he went out again in silence I SERVED Edward as his second clerk faithfully , punctually , diligently .
