# text = Once during my clerkship I had an invitation to Crimsworth Hall ; it was on the occasion of a large party given in honour of the master's birthday ; he had always been accustomed to invite his clerks on similar anniversaries , and could not well pass me over ; I was , however , kept strictly in the background .
