# text = Alone with Edward I remembered our relationship , and remembering that forgot the difference of position ; I put away deference and careful forms of speech ; I answered with simple brevity I said , turning the key in my desk he reiterated asked I was the answer He was going on in the same breath , when an abrupt pause announced that rage had for the moment got the better of articulation I replied this last term is , I believe , purely --- shire , and alludes to the horn of black , rancid whale-oil , usually to be seen suspended to cart-wheels , and employed for greasing the same He took down the heavy gig whip hanging beside his mackintosh .
