# text = After an odd and long stare at me , at once bull-like and amazed , he seemed to bethink himself that , after all , his money gave him sufficient superiority over a beggar like me , and that he had in his hands a surer and more dignified mode of revenge than the somewhat hazardous one of personal chastisement said he exclaimed Crimsworth .
