# text = Having cleared a plateful , I became so far humanized as to intimate to Mr . Hunsden said he , and therewith he summoned the servant by a fresh pull of the bell-rope , and intimated a desire to have a glass of toast-and-water he added His orders being executed , he wheeled his chair round to the table , so as to be opposite me he proceeded said I ; and not disposed to show the satisfaction I felt on this point , I , yielding to the whim of the moment , took up the subject as though I considered myself aggrieved rather than benefited by what had been done Now this speech interested me much , both because it brought out Hunsden's character , and because it explained his motives ; it interested me so much that I forgot to reply to it , and sat silent , pondering over a throng of ideas it had suggested he asked , presently .
