# text = The stove might be dismal-looking to some eyes , not to mine , but it was indisputably very warm , and there were two gentlemen seated by it talking in French ; impossible to follow their rapid utterance , or comprehend much of the purport of what they said -- yet French , in the mouths of Frenchmen , or Belgians ( I was not then sensible of the horrors of the Belgian accent ) was as music to my ears .
