# text = The gentleman , after looking towards me once or twice , politely accosted me in very good English ; I remember I wished to God that I could speak French as well ; his fluency and correct pronunciation impressed me for the first time with a due notion of the cosmopolitan character of the capital I was in ; it was my first experience of that skill in living languages I afterwards found to be so general in Brussels .
