# text = Certainly it was agreeable , when the day's work was over , to find one's employer an intelligent and cheerful companion ; and if he was sometimes a little sarcastic and sometimes a little too insinuating , and if I did discover that his mildness was more a matter of appearance than of reality -- if I did occasionally suspect the existence of flint or steel under an external covering of velvet -- still we are none of us perfect ; and weary as I was of the atmosphere of brutality and insolence in which I had constantly lived at X ----, I had no inclination now , on casting anchor in calmer regions , to institute at once a prying search after defects that were scrupulously withdrawn and carefully veiled from my view .
