# text = On these steps , by-the-by , I have not unfrequently seen Madame Pelet seated with a trencher on her knee , engaged in the threefold employment of eating her dinner , gossiping with her favourite servant , the housemaid , and scolding her antagonist , the cook ; she never dined , and seldom indeed took any meal with her son ; and as to showing her face at the boys' table , that was quite out of the question .
