# text = Madame Pelet's habits of life , then , being taken into consideration , I was a good deal surprised when , one Thursday evening ( Thursday was always a half-holiday ), as I was sitting all alone in my apartment , correcting a huge pile of English and Latin exercises , a servant tapped at the door , and , on its being opened , presented Madame Pelet's compliments , and she would be happy to see me to take my " gouter " ( a meal which answers to our English " tea ") with her in the dining-room said I , for I thought I must have misunderstood , the message and invitation were so unusual ; the same words were repeated .
