# text = At last I concluded it would be a waste of labour thought I And off I started , cursorily glancing sideways as I passed the toilet-table , surmounted by a looking-glass : a thin irregular face I saw , with sunk , dark eyes under a large , square forehead , complexion destitute of bloom or attraction ; something young , but not youthful , no object to win a lady's love , no butt for the shafts of Cupid .
