# text = Reuter had already glided away , she was nowhere visible ; a maitresse or teacher , the one who occupied the corresponding estrade to my own , alone remained to keep guard over me ; she was a little in the shade , and , with my short sight , I could only see that she was of a thin bony figure and rather tallowy complexion , and that her attitude , as she sat , partook equally of listlessness and affectation .
