# text = I watched her as keenly as she watched me ; I perceived soon that she was feeling after my real character ; she was searching for salient points , and weak ; points , and eccentric points ; she was applying now this test , now that , hoping in the end to find some chink , some niche , where she could put in her little firm foot and stand upon my neck -- mistress of my nature , Do not mistake me , reader , it was no amorous influence she wished to gain -- at that time it was only the power of the politician to which she aspired ; I was now installed as a professor in her establishment , and she wanted to know where her mind was superior to mine -- by what feeling or opinion she could lead me .
