# text = To be late at meals was against a standing rule of the establishment , and had it been one of the Flemish ushers who thus entered after the removal of the soup and the commencement of the first course , M . Pelet would probably have greeted him with a public rebuke , and would certainly have mulcted him both of soup and fish ; as it was , that polite though partial gentleman only shook his head , and as I took my place , unrolled my napkin , and said my heretical grace to myself , he civilly despatched a servant to the kitchen , to bring me a plate of " puree aux carottes " ( for this was a maigre-day ), and before sending away the first course , reserved for me a portion of the stock-fish of which it consisted .
