# text = In dress all were nearly similar , and in manners there was small difference ; exceptions there were to the general rule , but the majority gave the tone to the establishment , and that tone was rough , boisterous , masked by a point-blank disregard of all forbearance towards each other or their teachers ; an eager pursuit by each individual of her own interest and convenience ; and a coarse indifference to the interest and convenience of every one else .
