# text = If , in walking up the schoolroom , I pass near her , she puts out her foot that it may touch mine ; if I do not happen to observe the manoeuvre , and my boot comes in contact with her brodequin , she affects to fall into convulsions of suppressed laughter ; if I notice the snare and avoid it , she expresses her mortification in sullen muttering , where I hear myself abused in bad French , pronounced with an intolerable Low German accent .
