# text = I remember this well ; for , having sat up late that evening , correcting devoirs , and feeling weary and a little oppressed with the closeness of my small room , I opened the often-mentioned boarded window , whose boards , however , I had persuaded old Madame Pelet to have removed since I had filled the post of professor in the pensionnat de demoiselles , as , from that time , it was no longer " inconvenient " for me to overlook my own pupils at their sports .
