# text = I never before or since heard language enounced with such steam-engine haste . " Notre Pere qui etes au ciel " went off like a shot ; then followed an address to Marie and then an invocation to the saint of the day ; and then down they all sat , and the solemn (?) rite was over ; and I entered , flinging the door wide and striding in fast , as it was my wont to do now ; for I had found that in entering with aplomb , and mounting the estrade with emphasis , consisted the grand secret of ensuring immediate silence .
