# text = The folding-doors between the two classes , opened for the prayer , were instantly closed ; a maitresse , work-box in hand , took her seat at her appropriate desk ; the pupils sat still with their pens and books before them ; my three beauties in the van , now well humbled by a demeanour of consistent coolness , sat erect with their hands folded quietly on their knees ; they had given up giggling and whispering to each other , and no longer ventured to utter pert speeches in my presence ; they now only talked to me occasionally with their eyes , by means of which organs they could still , however , say very audacious and coquettish things .
