# text = Yet , having intimated that her appearance was peculiar , as being unlike that of her Flemish companions , I have little more to say respecting it ; I can pronounce no encomiums on her beauty , for she was not beautiful ; nor offer condolence on her plainness , for neither was she plain ; a careworn character of forehead , and a corresponding moulding of the mouth , struck me with a sentiment resembling surprise , but these traits would probably have passed unnoticed by any less crotchety observer .
