# text = Henri turned away ; dissatifaction was plainly evinced in her face , and a smile , slight and brief , but bitter , distrustful , and , I thought , scornful , curled her lip as she took her place in the class ; it was a secret , involuntary smile , which lasted but a second ; an air of depression succeeded , chased away presently by one of attention and interest , when I gave the word for all the pupils to take their reading-books .
