# text = Night was my usual time for correcting devoirs , and my own room the usual scene of such task -- task most onerous hitherto ; and it seemed strange to me to feel rising within me an incipient sense of interest , as I snuffed the candle and addressed myself to the perusal of the poor teacher's manuscript thought I The narrative commenced by a description of a Saxon peasant's hut , situated within the confines of a great , leafless , winter forest ; it represented an evening in December ; flakes of snow were falling , and the herdsman foretold a heavy storm ; he summoned his wife to aid him in collecting their flock , roaming far away on the pastoral banks of the Thone ; he warns her that it will be late ere they return .
