# text = The good woman is reluctant to quit her occupation of baking cakes for the evening meal ; but acknowledging the primary importance of securing the herds and flocks , she puts on her sheep-skin mantle ; and , addressing a stranger who rests half reclined on a bed of rushes near the hearth , bids him mind the bread till her return she continues , " that you fasten the door well after us ; and , above all , open to none in our absence ; whatever sound you hear , stir not , and look not out .
