# text = Thus did I accost her Accustomed by this time to the calculated abruptness of my manner , it no longer discomposed or surprised her , and she answered with only so much of hesitation as was rendered inevitable by the difficulty she experienced in improvising the translation of her thoughts from French to English A flush of painful confusion was the result of this harsh remark ; she bent her head to the desk , but soon raising it replied She stopped -- not evidently from any difficulty in finding words to express herself , but because discretion seemed to say I urged said I A servant here entered demanded Mdlle .
