# text = Her figure shared in this beneficial change ; it became rounder , and as the harmony of her form was complete and her stature of the graceful middle height , one did not regret ( or at least I did not regret ) the absence of confirmed fulness , in contours , still slight , though compact , elegant , flexible -- the exquisite turning of waist , wrist , hand , foot , and ankle satisfied completely my notions of symmetry , and allowed a lightness and freedom of movement which corresponded with my ideas of grace .
