# text = In the daytime , too , when I was about my duties , I put them on the silent system ; and it was only after I had closed the door of my chamber at night that I somewhat relaxed my severity towards these morose nurslings , and allowed vent to their language of murmurs ; then , in revenge , they sat on my pillow , haunted my bed , and kept me awake with their long , midnight cry .
