# text = In one sense a note will do as well -- it will wrap up the 20 francs , the price of the lessons I have received from you ; and if it will not fully express the thanks I owe you in addition -- if it will not bid you good-bye as I could wish to have done -- if it will not tell you , as I long to do , how sorry I am that I shall probably never see you more -- why , spoken words would hardly be more adequate to the task .
