# text = You often remarked , monsieur , that my devoirs dwelt a great deal on fortitude in bearing grief -- you said I introduced that theme too often : I find indeed that it is much easier to write about a severe duty than to perform it , for I am oppressed when I see and feel to what a reverse fate has condemned me ; you were kind to me , monsieur -- very kind ; I am afflicted -- I am heart-broken to be quite separated from you ; soon I shall have no friend on earth .
