# text = I approached , wondering to what house this well-protected garden appertained ; I turned the angle of the wall , thinking to see some stately residence ; I was close upon great iron gates ; there was a hut serving for a lodge near , but I had no occasion to apply for the key -- the gates were open ; I pushed one leaf back -- rain had rusted its hinges , for it groaned dolefully as they revolved .
