# text = I put on my spectacles , and passed softly close behind her ; glancing at the inscription on the stone , I read Having perused the inscription , I looked down at the form sitting bent and thoughtful just under my eyes , unconscious of the vicinity of any living thing ; it was a slim , youthful figure in mourning apparel of the plainest black stuff , with a little simple , black crape bonnet ; I felt , as well as saw , who it was ; and , moving neither hand nor foot , I stood some moments enjoying the security of conviction .
