# text = I had been forced to loosen my grasp on expectation ; and , but an hour ago , had sunk slackly under the discouraging thought that the current of life , and the impulse of destiny , had swept her for ever from my reach ; and , behold , while bending suddenly earthward beneath the pressure of despondency -- while following with my eyes the track of sorrow on the turf of a graveyard -- here was my lost jewel dropped on the tear-fed herbage , nestling in the messy and mouldy roots of yew-trees .
