# text = Reuter called one evening , just after I had got my aunt to bed ; she went into her room to speak to her , and was extremely civil and affable , as she always is ; afterwards she came and sat with me a long time , and just as she rose to go away , she said I laughed inwardly ; all this was so like the directress -- so like what I had expected and guessed of her conduct ; and then the exposure and proof of her lie , unconsciously afforded by Frances forsooth amp ; c ., & amp ; c ., and here I found her a visitor at the very house of whose locality she had professed absolute ignorance !
