# text = It was not far from the Rue de Louvain , and we stood on the doorsteps of the house we sought ere the clouds , severing with loud peal and shattered cataract of lightning , emptied their livid folds in a torrent , heavy , prone , and broad said Frances , as , after putting her into the house , I paused ere I followed : the word decided me ; I stepped across the threshold , shut the door on the rushing , flashing , whitening storm , and followed her upstairs to her apartments .
