# text = Her eye , as she re-entered the small sitting-room , instantly sought mine , which was just then lingering on the hearth ; I knew she read at once the sort of inward ruth and pitying pain which the chill vacancy of that hearth stirred in my soul : quick to penetrate , quick to determine , and quicker to put in practice , she had in a moment tied a holland apron round her waist ; then she disappeared , and reappeared with a basket ; it had a cover ; she opened it , and produced wood and coal ; deftly and compactly she arranged them in the grate thought I I asked She had struck a light ; the wood was already in a blaze ; and truly , when contrasted with the darkness , the wild tumult of the tempest without , that peaceful glow which began to beam on the now animated hearth , seemed very cheering .
