# text = While making these preparations , she chanced to look up , and , reading curiosity in my eyes , she smiled and asked I replied She put some pistolets on the table ; she made the tea , as foreigners do make tea -- i.e ., at the rate of a teaspoonful to half-a-dozen cups ; she placed me a chair , and , as I took it , she asked , with a sort of exaltation I answered ; and , in truth , there was a sort of illusion in seeing the fair-complexioned English-looking girl presiding at the English meal , and speaking in the English language was her remark
