# text = I obeyed , but I swore rancorously to be avenged one day for I had ever remarked , that however sad or harassed her countenance might be when I entered a room , yet after I had been near her , spoken to her a few words , given her some directions , uttered perhaps some reproofs , she would , all at once , nestle into a nook of happiness , and look up serene and revived .
