# text = I looked long ; my eye drank in the scene , and I suppose my brain must have absorbed it ; for that night , after lying awake in pleasant fever a long time , watching the silent sheet-lightning , which still played among the retreating clouds , and flashed silvery over the stars , I at last fell asleep ; and then in a dream were reproduced the setting sun , the bank of clouds , the mighty rainbow .
