# text = I stood , methought , on a terrace ; I leaned over a parapeted wall ; there was space below me , depth I could not fathom , but hearing an endless dash of waves , I believed it to be the sea ; sea spread to the horizon ; sea of changeful green and intense blue : all was soft in the distance ; all vapour-veiled .
