# text = It hovered as on wings ; pearly , fleecy , gleaming air streamed like raiment round it ; light , tinted with carnation , coloured what seemed face and limbs ; A large star shone with still lustre on an angel's forehead ; an upraised arm and hand , glancing like a ray , pointed to the bow overhead , and a voice in my heart whispered A COMPETENCY was what I wanted ; a competency it was now my aim and resolve to secure ; but never had I been farther from the mark .
