# text = I did not , it is true , like my position in his house ; but being freed from the annoyance of false professions and double-dealing I could endure it , especially as no heroic sentiment of hatred or jealousy of the director distracted my philosophical soul ; he had not , I found , wounded me in a very tender point , the wound was so soon and so radically healed , leaving only a sense of contempt for the treacherous fashion in which it had been inflicted , and a lasting mistrust of the hand which I had detected attempting to stab in the dark .
