# text = During the operation he did not fail to utter comminations which , though broken , had a sense in them ; while stigmatizing me as the treacherous spawn of a perfidious country , he , in the same breath , anathematized Zoraide Reuter ; he termed her who , in a fit of lewd caprice , had thrown herself away on an unprincipled adventurer ; directing the point of the last appellation by a furious blow , obliquely aimed at me .
