# text = Now , monsieur , the money is not mine , and I shall not keep it ; I will not send it in this note because it might be lost -- besides , it is heavy ; but I will restore it to you the first time I see you , and you must make no difficulties about taking it ; because , in the first place , I am sure , monsieur , you can understand that one likes to pay one's debts ; that it is satisfactory to owe no man anything ; and , in the second place , I can now very well afford to be honest , as I am provided with a situation .
