# text = Now for the first time did I truly feel what it was to be poor ; now did the sacrifice I had made in casting from me the means of living put on a new aspect ; instead of a correct , just , honourable act , it seemed a deed at once light and fanatical ; I took several turns in my room , under the goading influence of most poignant remorse ; I walked a quarter of an hour from the wall to the window ; and at the window , self-reproach seemed to face me ; at the wall , self-disdain : all at once out spoke Conscience cried she I sat down ; I propped my forehead on both my hands ; I thought and thought an hour-two hours ; vainly .
