# text = But there are chinks , or there may be chinks , in the best adjusted masonry ; there was a chink in my cavernous cell ; for , eventually , I saw , or seemed to see , a ray -- pallid , indeed , and cold , and doubtful , but still a ray , for it showed that narrow path which conscience had promised after two , three hours' torturing research in brain and memory , I disinterred certain remains of circumstances , and conceived a hope that by putting them together an expedient might be framed , and a resource discovered .
