# text = The circumstances were briefly these Some three months ago M . Pelet had , on the occasion of his fete , given the boys a treat , which treat consisted in a party of pleasure to a certain place of public resort in the outskirts of Brussels , of which I do not at this moment remember the name , but near it were several of those lakelets called etangs ; and there was one etang , larger than the rest , where on holidays people were accustomed to amuse themselves by rowing round it in little boats .
