# text = He had actually knocked at the door -- at MY door ; a smart , prompt rap ; and , almost before I could invite him in , he was over the threshold , and had closed the door behind him asked an indifferent , quiet voice , in the English language ; while my visitor , without any sort of bustle or introduction , put his hat on the table , and his gloves into his hat , and drawing the only armchair the room afforded a little forward , seated himself tranquilly therein he inquired in a few moments , in a tone whose nonchalance seemed to intimate that it was much the same thing whether I answered or not .
