# text = Some people , however indifferent they may become after a considerable space of absence , always contrive to leave a pleasant impression just at parting ; not so Hunsden , a conference with him affected one like a draught of Peruvian bark ; it seemed a concentration of the specially harsh , stringent , bitter ; whether , like bark , it invigorated , I scarcely knew .
