# text = A ruffled mind makes a restless pillow ; I slept little on the night after this interview ; towards morning I began to doze , but hardly had my slumber become sleep , when I was roused from it by hearing a noise in my sitting room , to which my bed-room adjoined -- a step , and a shoving of furniture ; the movement lasted barely two minutes ; with the closing of the door it ceased .
