# text = I was inquired about ; my former pupils' parents , gathering the reports of their children , heard me spoken of as talented , and they echoed the word : the sound , bandied about at random , came at last to ears which , but for its universality , it might never have reached ; and at the very crisis when I had tried my last effort and knew not what to do , Fortune looked in at me one morning , as I sat in drear and almost desperate deliberation on my bedstead , nodded with the familiarity of an old acquaintance -- though God knows I had never met her before -- and threw a prize into my lap .
