# text = Her face was grave , its expression concentrated ; she bent on me an unsmiling eye -- an eye just returning from abstraction , just awaking from dreams : well-arranged was her simple attire , smooth her dark hair , orderly her tranquil room ; but what -- with her thoughtful look , her serious self-reliance , her bent to meditation and haply inspiration -- what had she to do with love was the answer of her own sad , though gentle countenance ; it seemed to say Other women have such thoughts .
