# text = I know I did not reason , I did not plan or intend , yet , whereas one moment I was sitting solus on the chair near the table , the next , I held Frances on my knee , placed there with sharpness and decision , and retained with exceeding tenacity cried Frances , and was still : not another word escaped her lips ; sorely confounded she seemed during the lapse of the first few moments ; but the amazement soon subsided ; terror did not succeed , nor fury : after all , she was only a little nearer than she had ever been before , to one she habitually respected and trusted ; embarrassment might have impelled her to contend , but self-respect checked resistance where resistance was useless was my demand .
