# text = In truth I became aware that I was holding the said " main droite " in a somewhat ruthless grasp : I did as desired ; and , for the third time , asked more gently was the truthful rejoinder I felt the agitation of the heart , I saw " the purple light of love " cast its glowing reflection on cheeks , temples , neck ; I desired to consult the eye , but sheltering lash and lid forbade said the soft voice at last A pause ; then with a new , yet still subdued inflexion of the voice -- an inflexion which provoked while it pleased me -- accompanied , too , by a " sourire a la fois fin et timide " in perfect harmony with the tone Some moments were taken for reflection ; the answer , pronounced slowly , ran thus and she made a sort of movement , as if she would have clung to me , but restraining herself she only added with earnest emphasis I drew her a little nearer to my heart ; I took a first kiss from her lips , thereby sealing the compact , now framed between us ; afterwards she and I were silent , nor was our silence brief .
