# text = We walked in , and Frances rose from her seat near the table to receive us ; her mourning attire gave her a recluse , rather conventual , but withal very distinguished look ; its grave simplicity added nothing to beauty , but much to dignity ; the finish of the white collar and manchettes sufficed for a relief to the merino gown of solemn black ; ornament was forsworn .
