# text = Frances said to me , with a suddenness peculiar to her when she had been thinking long on a subject , and at last , having come to a conclusion , wished to test its soundness by the touchstone of my judgment demanded I , looking up from my coffee , which I had been deliberately stirring while enjoying , in anticipation , a walk I proposed to take with Frances , that fine summer day ( it was June ), to a certain farmhouse in the country , where we were to dine and I saw at once , in the serious ardour of her face , a project of vital importance .
