# text = " I am not satisfied " returned she : " you are now earning eight thousand francs a year " ( it was true ; my efforts , punctuality , the fame of my pupils' progress , the publicity of my station , had so far helped me on She went -- as docile as a well-trained child ; she was a curious mixture of tractability and firmness : I sat thinking about her , and wondering what her plan could be , when she re-entered .
