# text = " Monsieur , I have given Minnie " ( our bonne was my not very apposite reply ; but she looked so engaging in her light summer dress and little cottage bonnet , and her manner in speaking to me was then , as always , so unaffectedly and suavely respectful , that my heart expanded at the sight of her , and a kiss seemed necessary to content its importunity Minnie having departed in clean cap and smart shawl , we , too , set out , leaving the house solitary and silent -- silent , at least , but for the ticking of the clock .
