# text = Over such feeble fledglings the directress spread a wing of kindliest protection : it was to their bedside she came at night to tuck them warmly in ; it was after them she looked in winter to see that they always had a comfortable seat by the stove ; it was they who by turns were summoned to the salon to receive some little dole of cake or fruit -- to sit on a footstool at the fireside -- to enjoy home comforts , and almost home liberty , for an evening together -- to be spoken to gently and softly , comforted , encouraged , cherished -- and when bedtime came , dismissed with a kiss of true tenderness .
